      "requires": [],
      "duration_days": 0,
      "final": false,
      "notes": "The 3 conquest missions will be dynamic and the targests of the mission will be selected when the mission is picked. Care should be taken such that it selects provinces that are occupied by countries who are not more than twice as strong as the selected country or have an overlord who is. (measured by levy size)\nthe selection process should be as determastic as possible meaning that you can expect the same picks each time you load up a campaign\n\n\nThen each mission will be enabled when the county has taken the selected place\nthe mission will grant local bonuses to the acquired location such as a goods thoughput for that location\nif the country is venice the 3 conquest areas should instead be the 3 important trade ports in the easterne mediteranian that you can purchase at the cost of 300 ducats each\n\nhere is a list of every province\nalessandria_province aosta_province mondovi_province monferrato_province novara_province torino_province saluzzo_province\ncismonte_province levante_province pumonte_province punente_province\nbergamo_province brescia_province cremona_province mantua_province milano_province monza_province pavia_province valtellina_province ticino_province\nbelluno_province friuli_province padua_province venice_province verona_province vicenza_province\nbologna_province ferrara_province modena_province parma_province piacenza_province reggioem_province romagna_province urbino_province\narezzo_province florence_province grosseto_province lucca_province pisa_province siena_province\nmarche_province perugia_province \n\nif the country has less than 15 tax base when the mission tree is generated the missions should give 1000 mercenaries when the mission is selected and grant a wargoal on countries that occopy the province and remove their allies. The bonus to the province should be defered to \nyou should be able to use create_mercenaries effect to create free mercenaries. In this case the mission should require 80 gold and use that when the mission is picked\n\nif the country has less than 20 tax base they should have get 1 mission like the one for less than 15 tax base\n\nif the country has more than 200k population then it should select at least 1 mission that wants an area (shown in consolitation mission) instead of a province\nif the country has more than 500k population then it should select 3 missions that wants an area (shown in consolitation mission) instead of a province\n\n\n",
